Third-party notice

Portions of this software are derived from dsh-claude-style
(https://github.com/nwflower/dsh-claude-style), Copyright (c) 2026 Nwflower,
released under the MIT License reproduced below.

The derived parts are the fade and the slide:

- src/reveal/ — ported from packages/client/src/features/chat-reveal/
- src/follow/ — ported from packages/client/src/features/chat-follow/
  and packages/engine/src/{scroll-owner,scroll-ease,chat-dom}.ts
- src/frame.js, src/bus.js — adapted from packages/engine/src/

They were rewritten for this package: TypeScript to JavaScript, the theme's
feature registry, settings rows and stylesheet pipeline removed, the marks
renamed, and the smoothed press added. The algorithms and their measured
constants come from there.

Everything else — the manifest, the host half, the assembly in src/client.js,
the rewritten src/{motion,session,stylesheet,params}.js, the build and the
test harnesses — is original to this package.

